body:
> Why is this needed for your project? Historically, we've been explicit on casting floats and ints.
> 
> Can you write a proposal for this enhancement?

It makes the same code x2 faster in gdscript.

```gdscript
@tool
extends Node2D


func _ready() -> void:
	var time: int = Time.get_ticks_msec()
	for i in 10000000:
		var v1 = Vector2(78 * 2.558, 78 * 2.558)
		var v2 = Vector2(1, 1) * 255.867 * sqrt(2)
		var f = sqrt(4) * 45.5
		var v3 = Vector2(f, f)
	print("Time Before: ", Time.get_ticks_msec() - time)
	time = Time.get_ticks_msec()
	for i in 10000000:
		var v1 = Vector2(78 * 2.558)
		var v2 = Vector2(255.867 * sqrt(2))
		var v3 = Vector2(sqrt(4) * 45.5)
	print("Time After: ", Time.get_ticks_msec() - time)
```

Time Before: 6868
Time After: 3396
